(7763876, 1286711, 173844, '<td valign="top">Okay, the number, but it''s really the tissue montage that makes it soar.  Delicate, like paper flowers blossoming in water.  Also the lines, a kind of establishing grid that is not unfriendly.  Is this your town?<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Okay, the number, but it''s really the tissue montage that makes it soar.  Delicate, like paper flowers blossoming in water.  Also the lines, a kind of establishing grid that is not unfriendly.  Is this your town?Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2024-02-18 21:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7763877, 1286743, 173844, '<td valign="top">Though a modest scene, the mood is complicated.  Feels a mix of serene and ominous, and the clock is a strong presence.  The grainy shadows have a life of their own.  The eccentric composition works well.  Nice.<br/>Personal second-favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Though a modest scene, the mood is complicated.  Feels a mix of serene and ominous, and the clock is a strong presence.  The grainy shadows have a life of their own.  The eccentric composition works well.  Nice.Personal second-favorite of the challenge.', '2024-02-18 22:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
