(7763885, 1286740, 77196, '<td valign="top">My suggestions would be to rotate slightly to your left, making the 42 42 42 42 42 more centered. To the right of the post doesn''t add to the photograph, and and getting the entire left overhead sign might have removed a distraction. Maybe straightening - the strong horizontal lines accentuate the tilt. And maybe a bit more "breathing room" for the ladies'' foot - the top of the image isn''t buying you anything either. <br/>I really did like the shot - reminds me of "Waiting on Godot ... er Subway" Nice exposure. Great mood!<br/></td>', 'My suggestions would be to rotate slightly to your left, making the 42 42 42 42 42 more centered. To the right of the post doesn''t add to the photograph, and and getting the entire left overhead sign might have removed a distraction. Maybe straightening - the strong horizontal lines accentuate the tilt. And maybe a bit more "breathing room" for the ladies'' foot - the top of the image isn''t buying you anything either. I really did like the shot - reminds me of "Waiting on Godot ... er Subway" Nice exposure. Great mood!', '2024-02-19 00:49:16.000000', NULL, 0),
